==Battleground==
*1 [[Suidae Piggicus]] spawns.
*1 [[Zory]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*3 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Commander Ostromeda]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns.
**3 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Cadaver Bear]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Commander Ostromeda]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**1 [[Infernal Pegasus Deonil]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Suidae Piggicus]] spawns.
**1 [[Cadaver Bear]] spawns.
**4 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**1 [[Dread Bore]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

